d=A.b(["Very low premium payable by farmer: Max 2% for Kharif food/oilseeds, 1.5% for Rabi, 5% for Annual Commercial/Horticultural crops.","Remaining premium subsidized equally by Central and State Governments.","Coverage for prevented sowing, localized calamities (hailstorm, cloudburst), and mid-season adversity."],f)
q=A.b(["Aadhaar Card","Land Record (Khatauni / Patta / Land Possession Certificate)","Sowing Certificate issued by Village Administrative Officer / Patwari","Bank Passbook copy showing IFSC"],f)
q=A.u4(A.b(["Step 1: Access the National Crop Insurance Portal (pmfby.gov.in) or enroll through bank / CSC.","Step 2: Submit crop insurance proposal before cut-off date for the respective season.","Step 3: Pay the subsidized farmer premium and collect insurance receipt/policy number.","Step 4: In case of crop loss, report within 72 hours via Crop Insurance Mobile App."],f),d,"Insurance","Provides affordable crop insurance coverage to stabilize farmers income against losses caused by droughts, floods, landslides, natural fire, pests, and unseasonal rains.",e,"scheme_pmfby",i,"Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana (PMFBY)","Department of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare","https://pmfby.gov.in",q,"Comprehensive crop insurance against non-preventable natural risks from pre-sowing to post-harvest.")
